WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.368
Pandemic response audit.

00:00:02.318 --> 00:00:04.738
What went wrong and who profited.

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:10.488
Canada's COVID-19 response exposed every institutional failure documented on this site.

00:00:10.488 --> 00:00:14.431
The national emergency stockpile was depleted and expired.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:20.647
Pharmaceutical API dependence on China and India left Canada unable to manufacture medicines.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.068
ArriveCAN cost fifty-nine million dollars for an eighty-thousand-dollar app.

00:00:25.068 --> 00:00:30.022
MAID was expanded to non-terminal conditions during the crisis via Bill C-7.

00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:33.988
The Emergencies Act was invoked and later ruled unreasonable.

00:00:33.988 --> 00:00:40.181
Each failure maps directly to the institutional capture documented across two hundred and forty-one pages.

00:00:40.181 --> 00:00:43.136
The pandemic didn't create these failures.

00:00:43.136 --> 00:00:44.829
It exposed them.

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:47.590
The pandemic didn't create the failures.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.284
It exposed them.

00:00:49.284 --> 00:00:55.113
Every pandemic response failure maps directly to the institutional capture documented across this site.

00:00:55.113 --> 00:00:59.670
The stockpile was depleted because the institutions responsible weren't accountable.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:05.386
The pharmaceutical supply was foreign because decades of offshoring prioritised cost over sovereignty.

00:01:05.386 --> 00:01:11.636
ArriveCAN cost sixty times its estimate because procurement is captured by the lobbying industrial complex.

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:17.556
MAID was expanded because the healthcare system's failure created demand for death as an alternative to treatment.

00:01:17.556 --> 00:01:24.068
The Emergencies Act was invoked because captured institutions chose political control over democratic process.

00:01:24.068 --> 00:01:27.931
The pandemic was a stress test for Canadian institutions.

00:01:27.931 --> 00:01:29.749
They all failed.

00:01:29.749 --> 00:01:32.102
And the failures are documented.
